WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.779 --> 00:00:02.390
Where do I even begin?

2
00:00:02.570 --> 00:00:06.123
Well, let’s start with small steps.

3
00:00:06.331 --> 00:00:09.636
Is there anything we can help you with tonight
before you get some sleep?

4
00:00:10.506 --> 00:00:13.685
I don’t even know where my parents
and I are going to sleep tonight...

5
00:00:15.068 --> 00:00:18.767
Well, I heard they’re converting a local school
into temporary accommodation,

6
00:00:19.127 --> 00:00:21.932
shall we go over and get a room for you and your parents?

7
00:00:22.596 --> 00:00:25.206
Ah, I didn’t know they were doing that.

8
00:00:25.697 --> 00:00:29.142
Sure, that sounds like a good first step.

9
00:00:34.218 --> 00:00:36.213
Raul! Good morning, how are you?

10
00:00:36.426 --> 00:00:39.677
Carlos, welcome to my home, or what’s left of it...

11
00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:41.689
My leg has almost healed

12
00:00:41.718 --> 00:00:45.286
and your colleagues have been helping
me to clear up the debris.

13
00:00:45.453 --> 00:00:47.982
It’s almost ready for us to build a new ranch.

14
00:00:48.166 --> 00:00:51.604
Wow, that’s great!
Did you know the mayor is arriving tomorrow?

15
00:00:51.821 --> 00:00:54.873
Apparently, she will unveil more relief packages.

16
00:00:55.069 --> 00:00:56.273
Oh, really?

17
00:00:56.394 --> 00:01:00.242
Great, I wonder if it will help
to rebuild my ranch any quicker.

18
00:01:00.514 --> 00:01:04.034
If you come to the announcement,
I can also introduce you to some of the volunteers

19
00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:06.121
that just finished building a new church. 

20
00:01:06.381 --> 00:01:08.133
Maybe they can help with your ranch too?

21
00:01:08.508 --> 00:01:11.896
Then, we can get a cup of that famous coffee
you’ve been telling me about!

22
00:01:12.285 --> 00:01:13.372
You’re on!

23
00:01:14.024 --> 00:01:17.915
But first, how about you put these
gloves on and help me clear this area?

24
00:01:17.966 --> 00:01:19.337
Yes boss!

